{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>My covenant of peace.</b> Its sense: את בריתי ברית שלום (my covenant, a covenant of peace), like כסאך אלהים (your throne, O Elohim) [Psalms 45:7], and many like it. The reason: he need not fear the kinsmen of Zimri, for he is a prince of a father's house, and his reward is that it shall be for him and for his seed after him a covenant of eternal priesthood forever, for the High Priests were of the sons of Phinehas. And it is possible that Elazar had other sons."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:19:29.139287051Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}